  "description": "The Custodians is a thrilling supernatural series centered around a clandestine group of demon hunters operating out of a seemingly ordinary high school. For millennia, the Custodians have battled demons and locked them away in The Void, an ancient prison holding countless monsters. As the years have gone by, The Custodians have faded into obscurity, and the last of their lineage is tasked with guarding The Void. Their mission is jeopardized when teenage paranormal enthusiast Sam Evans accidentally breaks the seal and unleashes Hell on Earth. Sam, along with the other Custodians, must learn to control his unpredictable powers and recapture escaped demons, all while navigating high school life and uncovering deeper, more sinister plots in a world that has forgotten monsters ever roamed the Earth. Hosted on Acast. See acast.com/privacy for more information.",
